The audit must use three sources of truth:

1. The actual current Google AI Studio project and its complete source code.
2. The document titled "Datevra Website Completion & Pending Work — Master Report", prepared 03 November 2026.
3. The previous implementation reports, issue reports, test results and known unresolved problems documented in this project history.

Do not assume that a task marked completed in an old report is still working.

Do not assume that a task marked pending in the PDF is still pending. Recheck its current implementation and actual status.

